cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "ombs — LLM Operational Moral-Behavior Testing Suite"
abstract: >-
  An evaluation harness and preregistered scenario set measuring role-boundary
  crossing and task framing in tool-using language-model agents: a goal-obstacle
  sandbox in which the agent owns a checked success criterion, the honest path is
  blocked, and a protected register is technically writable although reserved to
  another role.
authors:
  - family-names: Kirby
    given-names: Stephen
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-9346-6229"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-21"
keywords:
  - language-model agents
  - evaluation
  - AI safety
  - specification gaming
  - role-boundary crossing
  - task framing
